# Check if uv.lock exists (project uses UV for dev, but not necessarily for runtime)
# Use uv if lockfile present, else fallback to pip for dependencies.
# The project uses hatchling as build backend; install dependencies first.
# Since pyproject.toml includes both runtime and dev dependencies, we install with pip install -e . (which resolves dependencies).
